# Password Generator

this is my password generator project made in python
i made this for CodSoft internship task 3
made by Harshita Singh

## about this project

this program generates a random password for you
you can choose what type of password you want
simple medium or strong
i used random module for this project

## how to run

open terminal and type
```
python password_generator.py
```

## what it can do

- generate simple password (only letters)
- generate medium password (letters and numbers)
- generate strong password (letters numbers and symbols)
- you can choose how long the password should be

## things i used

- python
- random module
- while loop
- if conditions
- for loop

## how it works

first it shows you 3 options simple medium strong
you select which type you want
then it asks how many characters you want
then it generates the password and shows it

## symbols i used in strong password

only these symbols i added  !  @  #  $
i kept it simple so password is easy to use everywhere

## one thing i noticed

every time you run it gives different password
because i used random.choice
so same length will give different password each time
i thought that was cool so i kept it

